{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "51145479a45dc34e8d4e2af425a72760fe5d5ab65356c4e4558035cc45b21cbd", "ja": "モデルのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "模特儿工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f656dd1a729ca5d4d7708a62fa24279bf5911721ea0b0c75921a55d5faab7e86", "ja": "伊吹翼でーす♪　すっごくかわいくてオシャレな服が\nいっぱい着られるって聞いて、楽しみにしてきました！", "zh": "我是伊吹翼～♪听说可以穿到很多\n超可爱又时髦的衣服，所以很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2c9e328f8f1e013d06c05b87384b5e2188e0c69c5bc52b8f87f845db986c637f", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーすっ♪", "zh": "请多多指教～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3003_p", "source_sha256": "ea774f1304f760b749740e27e5828b44ff7814058e0db1b8a1469604e11d18a2", "ja": "（さすが翼だな……有名ファッション誌のモデルに\n突然起用されたっていうのに、全く物怖じしてない）", "zh": "（真不愧是翼……临时被任用为\n知名时尚杂志的模特儿，却完全不怯场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3004_p", "source_sha256": "2549753fa13fb0f813e3a0838f52c8359627a227e6d59671c478898a55aedcf8", "ja": "（まぁ、本人のやる気も十分だし、\n今日は何も心配することはなさそうかな……）", "zh": "（不过，本人也干劲十足，\n看来今天应该没什么需要担心的问题吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "87bc45136e0fad0ee40743d9191f104ad804521ad94dcbd098f5d4f3055597d8", "ja": "……{$P$}さんっ！　たいへん～！", "zh": "……{$P$}先生！不好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3006_p", "source_sha256": "4f96a45235b198afec75f42449890fdd1d96c2ae85c42137be7271da84a840b1", "ja": "あれ？　どうしたんだ、翼。\nまだ衣装に着替えてないのか？", "zh": "咦？怎么了？翼。\n你还没有换衣服啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1c0b43a516e7f61784020e171ce7d882c44c4e0be0bbd5db7cb56b517cdbbc45", "ja": "それが、衣装が2つ用意されてて……。両方かわいくて\nオシャレなのに、どっちか選んでいいって……。", "zh": "那是因为委托方准备了两套服装……可是两边\n都好可爱好时髦，我不晓得该选哪一套好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0f0dd788d314a0fde76a21027a6a3d5a58b6780087c1f29b5c8a183f900a7b43", "ja": "も～！　こんなの、両方、着たくなっちゃいますよ～！\n{$P$}さん、選んで～！", "zh": "讨厌～！这样子会让人两种都想穿啦～！\n{$P$}先生，帮我选～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3009", "source_sha256": "c17a6c25e69c67e4dddf2a2c7f1ff6c1b46ae5cdcb11b3f3aecfb3d33032ce49", "ja": "クールな衣装", "zh": "酷帅的服装", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3010", "source_sha256": "f779a7ca6c192efb1f9bf0ab01cc0734d21829a531c2c85387526085262316d6", "ja": "キュートな衣装", "zh": "可爱的服装", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3200_p", "source_sha256": "d288b151df46a483ac40df09266d6af8030b8bcfae71c7cf6eb1c8e5a6ca8b15", "ja": "そうだな……クールで大人っぽい雰囲気の衣装は、\nきっと翼に似合うと思う。", "zh": "这个嘛……酷帅又有成熟感的服装，\n我想一定很适合翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3201_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fcd175b84f4a9050d54f2d8945957a24fc0914e03a779c01ac305b473b8cf2aa", "ja": "えへへ……わたし、大人っぽいですか……？\nわたしも、こっちがいいかなって思ってたんですよ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……我看起来很成熟吗……？\n我也觉得这套比较好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3202_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1ef13093dc2f66f6b05f9a536ddb07a903e98c846c5a9ebeed73baebd7b4762e", "ja": "そうだ！　せっかくだから、ちょっと大人なメイクを\nお願いしちゃおうっと！　えへへ、楽しみ～♪", "zh": "对了！反正难得有这个机会，就请化妆师\n帮我化成熟点的妆吧！嘿嘿，好期待～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3300_p", "source_sha256": "d288b151df46a483ac40df09266d6af8030b8bcfae71c7cf6eb1c8e5a6ca8b15", "ja": "そうだな……クールで大人っぽい雰囲気の衣装は、\nきっと翼に似合うと思う。", "zh": "这个嘛……酷帅又有成熟感的服装，\n我想一定很适合翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3301_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8228e52b198bff9d87db033b00cf0b976fc3fe552d8fafb95fa2afc0606442a5", "ja": "え～？　わたし、クールって感じですか？\n初めて言われたかも～。", "zh": "咦～？我给人酷帅的感觉吗？\n搞不好是第一次有人这么说我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3302_p", "source_sha256": "e9b43fa5f048f8c834c99833d6d9a1e9cce6f540202a0e8e3b51b59f5ea5256e", "ja": "意外性っていうのかな。\n可愛いから、カッコイイのも似合うと思うってやつだ。", "zh": "这应该说是所谓的意外感吧。\n因为你很可爱，所以帅气的装扮也会很适合的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3303_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d1bfff75858feba6f2d6635450c9d25cc009c7a7d363bb338abcc30894105daf", "ja": "えへへ、そっかー。\nじゃあ今回は、カッコイイ方にしますねー。", "zh": "嘿嘿，这样啊～\n那这次我就选帅气的服装啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3500_p", "source_sha256": "012f8c33f10d2c60fda4cd3d4ce8bf380ca35cfad766771d5eeb93e9a8130a82", "ja": "そうだな。\nそっちの衣装は可愛くて、翼にピッタリだと思うぞ。", "zh": "这个嘛。\n那套服装很可爱，我认为非常适合翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3501_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f45e27857fd890de94605567397af4876e7a1834b9c161b010555d30578fb1f3", "ja": "ふ～ん……{$P$}さんってば、\nこういうのが好みなんですね～？", "zh": "哦……{$P$}先生真是的，\n你其实喜欢这种类型的吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3502_p", "source_sha256": "0cb0cbb7c7d3a4e3b99f7565dc82dfdcdb01908e25cbd46edf06235f21bcb7a1", "ja": "いや、俺の好みの問題じゃなくてな……。", "zh": "不是，这不是我的喜好问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3503_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0330c4ff8b38349b60385e0572d33e88ef5ab366fc64ec1c4d2a2ca9a4798860", "ja": "じゃあ今回は、こっちのカワイイ方で♪\n今後の参考にさせてもらいま～す♪　えへへっ。", "zh": "那这次就选这套可爱的服装♪\n然后作为今后的参考～♪嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3600_p", "source_sha256": "012f8c33f10d2c60fda4cd3d4ce8bf380ca35cfad766771d5eeb93e9a8130a82", "ja": "そうだな。\nそっちの衣装は可愛くて、翼にピッタリだと思うぞ。", "zh": "这个嘛。\n那套服装很可爱，我认为非常适合翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3601_016tsu", "source_sha256": "52759c0247776a2fb3af2cf366483cb9cb1f5118a6da41bfceeb4656afe04c1d", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、大人っぽい方が\n好きかと思ってました……けっこう、意外かも♪", "zh": "我还以为{$P$}先生的话，\n会比较喜欢成熟点的风格呢……感觉挺意外的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_016tsu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_016tsu_3602_016tsu", "source_sha256": "16550cd2efe202ddd9d4db10802d79ac2152724a1c2c8d03a6fcd03bed4710c1", "ja": "じゃあ、こっちにしよっと！　バッチリかわいく\n着こなしちゃいますから、期待しててくださいね～♪", "zh": "那就选这套吧！我会把衣服呈现得很可爱，\n敬请期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
